===Etymology===
From {{etyl|xno|en}} {{m|fro|apurtenance}}, from {{etyl|fro|en}} {{m|fro|apartenance}}, from {{m|fro|apartenir}}, from {{etyl|la|en}} {{m|la|appertineō||I belong, I appertain}}. More at {{l|en|appertain}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|En-us-ncalif-appurtenance.ogg|Audio (Northern California, US)|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# An [[appendage]] added to something else.
# {{lb|en|in the plural}} [[equipment|Equipment]] used for some specific [[task]]; [[gear]].
# The thing to which another [[pertain|pertains]].
# {{lb|en|legal}} Minor [[property]] (such as an [[outhouse]]) that passes with the main property when it is [[sold]].
# {{lb|en|grammar}} A [[modifier]] that is [[append]]ed or [[prepend]]ed to another word to [[coin]] a new word that expresses belonging.

